[{"title":"杜甫游春","author":"罗亨信","text":"满目春光景物妍，蹇驴徐步慢扬鞭。\n杜陵诗客情如许，那惜花村买酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明赏菊","author":"罗亨信","text":"五柳庄前九日临，黄花开遍绕篱金。\n壶觞自引酬佳节，醉倚西风发浩吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林逋观梅","author":"罗亨信","text":"昨夜西湖雪半消，枝南枝北尽琼瑶。\n杖藜试过溪桥去，香气侵人思欲飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"濂溪观莲","author":"罗亨信","text":"芙蕖灼灼绚红霞，吟倚危阑兴倍加。\n忆昔濂溪陈迹杳，画图赢得世人誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"右军观鹅","author":"罗亨信","text":"写就黄庭换白鹅，笼归闲放浴晴波。\n日长独倚危阑玩，两袖薰风逸兴多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东坡画竹","author":"罗亨信","text":"坡翁仙去已多年，翰墨空遗后世传。\n半幅溪藤双凤翥，渭川风景自依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈抟高卧","author":"罗亨信","text":"华山深处是衡茅，一枕清风百虑抛。\n徵使远临犹未醒，任教红日转松梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子房进履","author":"罗亨信","text":"孺子才华间世奇，圯桥相遇即相知。\n不因进履传兵法，寸舌那能作帝师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏秦受业","author":"罗亨信","text":"道义悠悠贯古今，当时讲授意精深。\n如何只用权谋术，不说经纶济世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二仙共语","author":"罗亨信","text":"二仙谈道日忘休，顷刻宁知是几秋。\n服得丹砂应不老，相期蓬岛共遨游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瘦马","author":"罗亨信","text":"汗血曾收野战功，沙场千里疾如风。\n只今老去无筋力，卧向斜阳碧草中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立马","author":"罗亨信","text":"饮罢龙河上御堤，奚官鞚立蹙霜蹄。\n孙阳未遇无知己，羞向东风不肯嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走马","author":"罗亨信","text":"蹄翻碧玉势如飞，龙种由来间世稀。\n忆在穆王乘八骏，共誇造父善驱驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858